---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { pageUrl } from '../data/urls';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | Akshayan Mohandass"
  description="How this portfolio handles contact form submissions, optional voice input, and browser storage."
  showAura={false}
>
  <main class="privacy-page" id="main-content">
    <a class="back mono" href={pageUrl('/')}>← Back to portfolio</a>
    <p class="eyebrow mono">PRIVACY / LAST UPDATED SEPTEMBER 2026</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact form</h2>
      <p>When you send a message, your name, email address, and message are transmitted through EmailJS so Akshayan can reply. Do not include confidential or sensitive information.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>AURA assistant</h2>
      <p>AURA answers from information published in this portfolio. Optional voice features use browser capabilities and may download model files to your device. Microphone access starts only after you choose the voice control and approve the browser permission.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Browser storage</h2>
      <p>The site may use session storage to remember temporary AURA preferences and interface position. It does not use advertising cookies or cross-site tracking.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>LinkedIn, Google Drive, Google Fonts, and EmailJS apply their own privacy practices when you use their services.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:akshayanmohandass@gmail.com">akshayanmohandass@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-page { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(96px, 12vw, 150px) 0; }
  .back { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 64px; color: var(--primary); font-size: var(--text-sm); }
  .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--grey); font-size: var(--text-xs); letter-spacing: .12em; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: 64px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(5rem, 14vw, 10rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: .86; text-transform: uppercase; }
  section { padding: 28px 0; border-top: var(--border-thin); }
  h2 { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: var(--text-xl); }
  p { max-width: 66ch; color: var(--dark-grey); line-height: 1.8; }
  section a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
</style>
